# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Phase 0 captures
#
# Raw hardware captures are large and stay out of git. The ALIGNED REFERENCE
# SET under captures/reference/ is the exception - it is the null-test's
# ground truth and must be versioned. Use Git LFS for it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
captures/
!captures/reference/
!captures/reference/**

# Rendered output for comparison - regenerated, never committed
captures/rendered/
nulltest-results.json

# Build artefacts
*.vst3
*.component
*.aaxplugin
*.dll
*.dylib
*.so

# Signing material - never commit
*.p12
*.cer
*.provisionprofile
